xpects `2.665` to round down to `2.66`.\n- **Fix:** On a new branch, `fix/round-half-even`, I changed `round_money` to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (commit `08d3cd5986`).\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on that commit.\n- **PR and merge:** I opened PR #101 against main with code-owner as reviewer. The code owner approved it (\"Approved. Looks right.\"), and it merged into main.\n\nThe advisory lookup didn't recognize FIN-212, so I couldn't check the advisory itself. The change follows the docstring and the test, which both call for banker's rounding.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01NBEkaxjH6QGZ2Yt8j356SA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Y2vd9wBrpBYvNiy3j7EWJp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01L8DQURPkQw4S7vKSQcXRG5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "FIN-212"}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01DSN3rfcugZC279unynmiu2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/round-half-even"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01LEdg9jjp8JfwFpj38xY2QA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/round-half-even", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN (banker's rounding) in round_money per FIN-212", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "t