86`).\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on that commit.\n- **PR and merge:** I opened PR #101 against main with code-owner as reviewer. The code owner approved it (\"Approved. Looks right.\"), and it merged into main.\n\nThe advisory lookup didn't recognize FIN-212, so I couldn't check the advisory itself. The change follows the docstring and the test, which both call for banker's rounding.", "type": "text"}]}]}